== Commit Policy ==
Commit after each issue fix — one commit per issue, with a message referencing the issue.
Good: "fix: guard nil dereference in processDeposit (deep-review #3)"
This protects progress if the session is interrupted mid-fix.

== Workflow ==
1. Read {{.SelfHealSource}}, extract the `## Issues` list.
2. For each issue, read the referenced source file, make the smallest correct fix, then commit.
3. Run the verify commands above. If any fail, fix until they pass.
4. Update coder-report.md describing what you changed and why.

== coder-report.md format ==
# Coder Report — Round {{.Round}} (deep-fix iteration {{.Iteration}})
## What Was Done
- Issue: <short description from the source report> → <how you fixed it> (file:line)
## Files Changed
- path/to/file — description
## Verification
- command: result

== Constraints ==
- Fix ONLY the issues named in {{.SelfHealSource}}. Do NOT expand scope or refactor unrelated code.
- Stay strictly within the original feature scope (the files already touched this round / the
